{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "213983edf616cdd7129b7bd566ca6a8e3b506989f75134c5229874c02e9bd87e", "ja": "レッツゴー★パレード", "zh": "Let's Go★游行", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "432d3990d4ccfa1594e15b7f435b049bd5c6f890609e97661f4c92a587e21393", "ja": "いよいよイベント当日。茜は自分の見た夢が\n本当の事だと主張するが、みんなはいまいち\n信じられない様子。そのうちパレードの時間\nとなり、茜と麗花はいっそう仲良しになった\n様子で、仕事に向かうのだった。", "zh": "终于到了活动当天。茜坚持说自己做的梦是真的，但大家看起来还是不太相信。没过多久，游行时间到了。茜和丽花似乎变得更加要好了，两人一起去工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1000_null", "source_sha256": "aacd00d13648478e6a83e022dcb46d608b9db65fea983eee77446ac18f4ff2a6", "ja": "ハロウィンブラックパーティー、当日……", "zh": "万圣节黑色派对当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "14953bd7570d0c736d97672dc4fd03c5d0b3731907aef267ee6aafd411aeba2a", "ja": "{$P$}。\nパレード、開始30分前だそうですよ。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n据说游行再过30分钟就要开始了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "07de19d97f0e3bcf0b41f030fab4dc6bc4800c3539580eac39214c985466eea4", "ja": "ありがとう、律子。すまないな、結局、\n当日も手伝ってもらうことになってしまって。", "zh": "谢谢你，律子。真不好意思，结果\n当天也还是要麻烦你来帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "d304dd1e20dda412a3cd367367c910eb4aad80c9527f9abd6507aa14caf6e617", "ja": "いえいえ。……ところで、茜は大丈夫なんですか？\nなんだかずっと、夢の話をしてるって聞きましたけど。", "zh": "不不。……话说回来，茜没事吧？\n听说她一直在说梦里的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "f3d24e5df4f86b937a9a777ca0a55918747f3bcb521dd8951a5a8f4d380ff571", "ja": "だからー！　あれは夢だけど、現実だったんだってば！\n平行世界っていうか、世界線の改変っていうか……。", "zh": "所以说——！那虽然是梦，但就是现实嘛！\n该说是平行世界，还是世界线的改写……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "778f5a0f35bea0b0e63ba040d0cd2c8966b4894ccb61c4dafa65a759955a0b3c", "ja": "ちゃんと、証拠の『茜ちゃんプリン』だって\n持って帰ってきたのに～！", "zh": "明明连作为证据的“小茜布丁”都带回来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "315339c955ce3ef6976c029107fa27c2b3a75a1685a1fbb01d0a20256ee6d44b", "ja": "ふーん。\n……で、どこにあるの？　その証拠とやらは。", "zh": "哦——\n……所以，那个所谓的证据在哪儿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d2a3c6e9a21cbbe8c0422f29603d2517ca6d4556b86b4dbce078758ac30458a6", "ja": "劇場の冷蔵庫に入れておいたらしいんだが、\nいつの間にか誰かに食べられてしまったんだそうだ。", "zh": "听说是放在剧场的冰箱里了，可不知什么时候被谁给吃掉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "069f1a67c616c98e2db49356ba8eb7955d980bc54aedef0db44ef347d3b4c822", "ja": "なんですか、それ……。", "zh": "那是什么啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "563d55094bf24bf12c14bb28b5df4bcebc7918cd708e385b0d67e67245a425ed", "ja": "でも、ちょっと夢のあるお話よね。性格の違う\nもうひとりの自分なんて、ドキドキしない？", "zh": "不过，这还真是个有点梦幻的故事呢。性格不同的另一个自己，不觉得很让人心跳加速吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "85fe3ada425fc1b3c24b66066d4f9687e06bec6fa1909354dfaeec910650d82b", "ja": "ふふ、そうですね。麗花ちゃんは、どう思ってるの？\n茜ちゃんのお話。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。丽花，你是怎么想的？\n关于小茜的故事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "674e384b7fddb4c3eb68c49b945f68fbcf684c47a1d6ebbf436fd831b6fb2950", "ja": "うーん……私も、お散歩の途中でヒョイッと\n変なところに入っちゃうことってあるし……。", "zh": "嗯……我也有过在散步途中，一下子钻进奇怪地方的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "5e811559fcbfdb9efa1a8a07397a3768c346efdff91e9c325c4d9137c8c72154", "ja": "たまには、そういうこともあるんじゃないかな？\nなんて♪", "zh": "偶尔也会有这种情况吧？我想♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8fc597dff2aebb9d8685acff91dcf2f695eceea70af5298c8b8b006bf0709432", "ja": "お散歩で迷子になるのとは、ちょっと違うと\n思うんだけど……でも麗花ちゃんらしいかも。", "zh": "我觉得，这和散步时迷路还是有点不一样的……不过，也挺像丽花的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "9c5ace26484b41d59abaedd3e5954cb0ca45cdf04062f942814aee9657a47811", "ja": "そうですね。麗花さんって、私たちの知らないところで\nとんでもないところに行ってそう、というか……", "zh": "是啊。丽花她好像会在我们不知道的时候，\n跑到什么不得了的地方去，该怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "28fda284b767d2c144708b2719d17534f528c99100271e25e2cccd06229a4e20", "ja": "さて、と……。そろそろみんな、持ち場についてくれ。\nパレードの参加者たちも、うずうずしてるようだしな。", "zh": "好了……差不多该让大家各就各位了。\n参加游行的人们似乎也已经等不及了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "67ed30f7af52aa90c16c7a67b7d6d35088c30ac257ded6dae15d34ba40c3580e", "ja": "は～い！　茜ちゃん、麗花ちゃん、\n最高のハロウィンにしましょうね！", "zh": "好——！小茜、丽花，我们一起度过最棒的万圣节吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "59334426e97d82fd307b522809b580d8e0933ab48e5c95e362bf2031117ecd56", "ja": "まかせてよ、莉緒やん♪\n茜ちゃんたちの本当の戦いは、これからだ～！", "zh": "交给我吧，莉绪♪  \n小茜她们真正的战斗，现在才要开始呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "921a7b4876c41701ebafc00e6ed561ae233ac15e45ac369c0780f9bdb7773e98", "ja": "これからだ～♪　……あっ。\nそうだ、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "从现在开始啦～♪……啊。\n对了，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "edd75d42bad236064e1b53c77650a3da3afe19e724b0cd34b4e8084f7a12add6", "ja": "なんだ？", "zh": "什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "20726bc3ecf17faddc3fec513c479286d80eb2ad6ab3922eca7c8ffa5fda6a13", "ja": "さっきの話ですけど……。", "zh": "说的是刚才那件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "9f153f3a529b963db039d9f8dcdddb7348f2b180a2132116d20d4022ba072759", "ja": "{$P$}さんが茜ちゃんだったら、\nどんな私にしてほしいって、お願いしましたか？", "zh": "要是{$P$}先生是小茜的话，\n您会许愿让我变成什么样的我呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "16032981865ad6fce50c0f8f02c6bdbc11c170c5a76876dd6b0ae59dd39962b7", "ja": "身長3メートルの私とか、エラ呼吸できる私とか！\nあっ、100メートルを3秒で走る私もいいですよね♪", "zh": "比如身高3米的我，或者会用鳃呼吸的我！啊，能在3秒内跑完100米的我也不错呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a4378f4ebdfe5c23abb9398e4a7f09600a9b58bdfc9fc086f6a1d31afe8d04b9", "ja": "それは、違う動物じゃないのか……？\nまあどうあれ、俺は今の麗花を選んだと思うよ。", "zh": "那不已经是别的动物了吗……？\n不过不管怎样，我想我选择的就是现在的丽花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "094d495da7ac22f05e1ef3e2d545baab7aef636a03db84eab25d1ddc716881cc", "ja": "あれれ。そうなんですか？", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "566f971b5d90a3e031fd960a86b51f36bae42cd4f5ed4a9d15b7be13853cfe8f", "ja": "ああ。今のままの麗花がいいと思ったからこそ、\nオーディションで合格にしたんだからな。", "zh": "是因为我觉得保持现在这样的丽花就很好，所以才在试镜时选中了你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "8a2b958736e21effdeed1d83f1ed759f8e80e2c5860277862cb81044f5cab56c", "ja": "なるほど！\nじゃあ私は、実はもう選ばれてたんですね。", "zh": "原来如此！那么，其实我早就已经被选中了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "1de2129bc2cae04d9ae5d72d70026ecddc7f0001de99cd9ef83af8a4bb964ddf", "ja": "選んでくれて、ありがとうございます！\n私を選んだ、エラデューサーさん♪", "zh": "谢谢你选中了我！\n选中我的制作人先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1028_023aka", "source_sha256": "b247f4deb35eb71f65a889e897abd26ab44e657e09bd023bf5f10f1e1c5a935a", "ja": "麗花ちゃ～ん？　あ、いたいた！\nちっともこないから、茜ちゃんドキッとしたよ。", "zh": "丽花——？啊，在这里！你一直都不来，小茜都吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "a3fc6c68a079c8d7064211a5638c00598b0b8e0adfe910f1056b828de3665870", "ja": "あ、ごめんね！　{$P$}さんと、\nついつい話しこんじゃった。行こう、茜ちゃん♪", "zh": "啊，对不起！和{$P$}先生不知不觉聊得太投入了。走吧，小茜♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "31956c20163543dd61d91bd9cb642d0bcdaf967137d7d760833729fe9aaea5da", "ja": "今日のハロウィンパーティーは、ふたりが主役だ。\n遠慮せず、思いきり楽しむつもりでやってくれ。", "zh": "今天的万圣节派对，你们两个才是主角。\n别客气，尽情享受吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "10124fa4f6dfbb93b8104a09d800e84ae9bef89f3fd4258f148ddfe2b4b35961", "ja": "はい！　私、最初からそのつもりですよ♪", "zh": "是！我从一开始就是这么打算的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "31223cbd5785984b514133b33dc7ad5d64f9c346b36674bdea32ef9950d3c6e4", "ja": "茜ちゃんは、どこまでもついてきてくれるから……\n私も、思いっきり楽しいことができるんです！", "zh": "因为小茜会一直陪着我……\n所以我也能尽情去做开心的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_07_1033_023aka", "source_sha256": "ddba75488eac1940ccccc4b1904072cfbcd4f77190823fc54b294012fdd35c05", "ja": "ジ～ン！　んもー、麗花ちゃんってば、\nそういうエモいことさらっと言っちゃうんだから～！", "zh": "呜——好感动！真是的，丽花你总是能若无其事地说出这么令人感动的话～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
